  ❗❗❗   ==== Setting ====
      
 Untuk versi NinjaLegend  dan Ultimate Ninja legend  bisa menyimpan file  
 Bombard.png  & Bombard.Plist
 FxEx.png &  FxEx.Plist nya di Asset dan ubah setting lua nya sebagai berikut :
 
 (For the NinjaLegend and Ultimate Ninja Legend versions, you can place the Bombard.png  & Bombard.Plist
 FxEx.png &  FxEx.Plist  files in Assets and change the external settings as follows:)
 
 
1 Open folder lua in Asset
2 Open ui 
3 Open StartMenu.lua
 
4 Find this text :
    function enterSelectLayer(gameMode, enableCustomSelect)
    
Eter down and Add  this 
    tools.addSprites('Bombard.Plist')
    tools.addSprites('FxEx.Plist')
    
   
